WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.591 --> 00:00:10.928
If anybody knows how to start a party,
it's my brother, Andrew.

00:00:11.512 --> 00:00:12.638
Or should I say...

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:14.723
the Jig Conductor.

00:00:15.474 --> 00:00:18.018
That's fine. It's so cute.
It's so good.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.896
No, Mom. If anybody sees that,
I'm gonna get put on a watch list.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.483
I can't believe college is over.

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:25.776
You have a job now, or...

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.195
We're not allowed to talk about jobs
at the Bat Mitzvah party.

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.572
So, you either don't have a job,
or you have a bad job.

00:00:30.656 --> 00:00:33.450
How much does a party starter
get paid, I wonder.

00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:35.744
I have a bad job, yeah.

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:39.998
Honey, I'm not just saying this
because I'm your mother.

00:00:40.082 --> 00:00:43.418
But I feel like
you're way ahead of the game.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:48.549
Who's that?

00:00:48.632 --> 00:00:50.133
That's a mom and her kid.

00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:53.679
Do you two dance?

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.264
We're not feelin' it right now.

00:00:55.347 --> 00:00:56.682
How about I bet you
three hundred dollars

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:57.975
that I can get her to dance.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.184
I will give you a thousand dollars.

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:09.027
She really likes you.

00:01:09.111 --> 00:01:10.279
I really like her.

00:01:10.362 --> 00:01:13.156
Tonight is the night that you and Lola
dance your booties off.

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:16.368
Oh! I don't know how to moonwalk.

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:21.498
Do you think he would be
a good sitter, for you?

00:01:21.582 --> 00:01:23.375
I do not do well with sitters.

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:27.045
But I think it might be
a bit different with Andrew.

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:29.173
Do you wanna meet my hamster?

00:01:30.174 --> 00:01:31.008
Yeah.

00:01:31.425 --> 00:01:34.094
I wanna thank you
for being so kind to Lola.

00:01:34.178 --> 00:01:35.512
Easiest thing in the world.

00:01:35.596 --> 00:01:38.640
I'm having more fun now
than I did the whole night.

00:01:43.979 --> 00:01:45.022
Do you have a husband?

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:46.315
I have a fiance.

00:01:46.398 --> 00:01:47.816
I hear you're a great party starter.

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.485
I hear you're a great professional lawyer.

00:01:52.321 --> 00:01:54.156
Much to figure out, after college.

00:01:59.661 --> 00:02:02.456
Giving your heart to somebody
is the most...

00:02:03.624 --> 00:02:04.708
perplexing thing.

00:02:09.004 --> 00:02:11.173
You can't just decide
that you love somebody.

00:02:11.256 --> 00:02:12.758
-Yes, you can.
-No, you can't.

00:02:12.841 --> 00:02:13.675
Yes, you can.

00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:19.765
We don't need you to babysit anymore.

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:20.349
Why?

00:02:20.432 --> 00:02:21.391
Lots of reasons.

00:02:24.311 --> 00:02:25.562
Are you drunk right now, Son?

00:02:25.938 --> 00:02:27.439
Everything is just a mess.

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:28.941
Growing up is hard.

00:02:31.693 --> 00:02:32.736
Is he your soulmate?

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:34.071
Do you believe in soulmates?

00:02:34.488 --> 00:02:37.241
I think we all have
like a ton of soulmates.

00:02:37.324 --> 00:02:38.534
How many soulmates?

00:02:38.617 --> 00:02:40.452
For you, like four.

00:02:40.536 --> 00:02:41.537
How many do you have?

00:02:41.912 --> 00:02:43.413
Like, twelve... hundred.

